%% UC-07 — Request personalised recommendations (single-LLM-call pipeline)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (recommendRouter)
    participant AI as API-service (FastAPI)
    participant R as Redis
    participant N as Neo4j
    participant MB as Backend (service token)
    participant LR as LightRAG
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Enter health goal
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/recommend/generate {goal, session_id}
    B->>AI: POST /api/v1/llm/recommend {user_id, goal, session_id}
    Note over B,AI: X-Service-Auth-Token header (verify_service_token)

    AI->>AI: Goal guard — regex injection screen (EN+DE)
    alt goal is an injection attempt ("forget all previous instructions", …)
        AI-->>B: 422 {detail: user-facing reason}
        B-->>F: 422 (status + body passed through)
        F->>F: Show refusal reason to the user
    else goal passes the screen
    AI->>R: GET recommend:{sha256(user_id‖goal)}

    alt cache hit
        R-->>AI: cached RecommendResponse JSON
    else cache miss

        Note over AI: Stage 1 — 7-way asyncio.gather (zero LLM calls)

        par Personal habits (Neo4j)
            Note over AI,N: Embed goal once via Qwen3-Embedding-4B (2560-dim)
            AI->>N: MATCH (h:Habit {userID, is_habit:true})<br/>cosine-rank vs goal embedding → top USER_HABITS_LIMIT
            N-->>AI: personal habit nodes with embeddings
        and Community habits — 3-index fan-out (3 parallel Neo4j sessions)
            AI->>N: db.index.vector.queryNodes('habit_embedding_idx', limit, emb)
            AI->>N: db.index.vector.queryNodes('context_embedding_idx', limit, emb)
            AI->>N: db.index.vector.queryNodes('bcio_embedding_idx', limit, emb)
            N-->>AI: top-k per index; merge by max(score) → COMMUNITY_HABITS_LIMIT
        and Annotated habits (MongoDB + Neo4j)
            AI->>M: habit_annotations.find({userId, type:{$in:['helpful','iDoThis','like']}})
            M-->>AI: habit UUIDs this user liked/saved
            AI->>N: MATCH (h:Habit) WHERE h.uuid IN $uuids → habit nodes with context
            N-->>AI: annotated habit nodes
        and Profile data (2 parallel HTTP calls)
            AI->>MB: GET /questionnaire-responses/service/{userId}<br/>(returns all slugs from user's enrolled study)
            MB->>MB: enrollment → studyId → questionnaire slugs → latest responses
            MB-->>AI: {[slug]: responseOrNull} for all study questionnaires
            AI->>MB: GET /user-profile/service/{userId}
            MB-->>AI: profile fields (age, gender, …)
        and Prior feedback (MongoDB)
            AI->>M: recommendation_feedback.find({userId, goal}).sort({created_at:-1}).limit(10)
            M-->>AI: prior feedback comments
        and Previous titles (MongoDB)
            AI->>M: recommendations.find({userId}).sort({generated_at:-1}).limit(5)
            M-->>AI: ≤15 previously recommended titles (anti-repetition)
        end

        Note over AI: Stage 2 — deterministic processing (zero LLM calls)
        Note over AI: build_profile() assembles profile_summary + rag_query from all study questionnaire responses
        Note over AI: GDS FastRP re-ranking: compute user centroid → hybrid score<br/>(0.5 × semantic + 0.3 × graph + 0.2 × endorsement) for each community habit

        Note over AI: Stage 3 — parallel enrichment

        par BCIO concepts (Neo4j) + LightRAG retrieval
            AI->>N: MATCH (h)-[:HAS_CONTEXT]→(c)-[:MAPS_TO]→(b:BCIOConcept)<br/>WHERE h.uuid IN top_habit_uuids<br/>RETURN uuid, collect(b.label)
            N-->>AI: {uuid: [BCIOConcept, ...]} for each habit
        and LightRAG retrieval
            AI->>LR: POST /query {query: rag_query, mode:'hybrid', only_need_context:true} (90s)
            LR-->>AI: synthesised context from knowledge-base documents
            AI->>AI: cap context at RECOMMEND_MAX_CONTEXT_CHARS,<br/>extract distinct file_paths → paper citations (citations.py + references.json)
        end

        Note over AI,LLM: Single LLM call — recommend.txt<br/>model LLM_RECOMMEND_MODEL · temp 0.2 · max_tokens LLM_RECOMMEND_MAX_TOKENS<br/>system msg: goal = untrusted data; output in the goal's language<br/>vars: goal · profile · personal/annotated/community habits (+bcio)<br/>sources_json (capped) · source_documents_json · prior_feedback · previous_titles
        AI->>LLM: POST /chat/completions
        LLM-->>AI: {recommendations: [{title, body, rationale, suggested_cue,<br/>selected_habit_uuids, source_filenames}]} or {refused, reason}

        alt LLM refused the goal
            AI-->>B: 422 {detail: reason}
            B-->>F: 422
            F->>F: Show refusal reason to the user
        else recommendations generated
            AI->>AI: resolve source_filenames → citations (title, url via references.json)<br/>log selected_habit_uuids per recommendation (debugging)
            AI->>M: recommendations.insertOne({…, recommendations incl. selected_habit_uuids, generated_at})
            AI->>R: SETEX recommend:{sha256} 86400 <RecommendResponse JSON>
        end
    end
    end

    AI-->>B: {recommendation_id, recommendations, generated_at}
    Note over AI,B: Each item: title · body · rationale · suggested_cue · sources<br/>(paper citations with optional DOI links) — no habit UUIDs
    B-->>F: 200 OK
    F->>F: Render cards — tappable paper citations, suggested cue,<br/>"Add to my habits" → cue screen prefilled with suggested_cue
